= Past exam of the quantum condensed matter course of the University of Cambridge

Past-paper archive: https://www.sp.phy.cam.ac.uk/drp2/home. The archive lists papers for 2004–2018; worked solutions for these exams have not been verified. Lecture-problem solutions are not treated as past-exam solutions.

